  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project to promote the rights of the Mangyan people through strengthening maternal and child health in Abrad Ilog, Occidental Mindoro, Philippines.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Promoting the right.1 Communitybased rights promotion activities focusing on maternal and child health for the Mangyan  .2 Providing friendly maternal and child health services to the Mangyans through primary healthcare faciliti  1.3 Communitybased to provide maternal and child nutrition enhancement services tailored for the Mangyan 2. Enhancing the implementation capacity of inclusive social systems for the Mangyan by the local government2.1 Establishing a governance framework for the local government&apos;s inclusive maternal and child health program for the Mangyan1.1.1. Developing and disseminating awarenesspromoting educational materials tailored for the Mangyan1.1.2. Training about promoting the rights of the Mangyan for local health workers1.1.3. Implementing education schoolbased promoting the rights of the Mangyan</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">It aims to strengthen health rights of the Mangyan people and contribute to the promotion of the rights of the Mangyan people, who are socially vulnerable in Philippines.1. &#xBAA8;&#xC790;&#xBCF4;&#xAC74;&#xC11C;&#xBE44;&#xC2A4; &#xC911;&#xC2EC;&#xC758; &#xC0AC;&#xD68C;&#xBCF4;&#xC7A5; &#xC11C;&#xBE44;&#xC2A4; &#xC811;&#xADFC;&#xAD8C; &#xD5A5;&#xC0C1;  1.1 &#xC9C0;&#xC5ED;&#xC0AC;&#xD68C; &#xAE30;&#xBC18;&#xC73C;&#xB85C; &#xCD94;&#xC9C4;&#xB41C; &#xB9DD;&#xC580;&#xC871; &#xB300;&#xC0C1; &#xBAA8;&#xC790;&#xBCF4;&#xAC74; &#xC911; &#xC2EC;&#xC758; &#xAD8C;&#xB9AC;&#xC99D;&#xC9C4; &#xD65C;&#xB3D9;1.2 &#xC77C;&#xCC28;&#xBCF4;&#xAC74;&#xC2DC;&#xC124; &#xAE30;&#xBC18;&#xC758; &#xB9DD;&#xC580;&#xC871; &#xCE5C;&#xD654;&#xC801; &#xBAA8;&#xC131;&#xBCF4;&#xAC74; &#xC11C;&#xBE44;&#xC2A4; &#xC81C;&#xACF5;1.3 &#xC9C0;&#xC5ED;&#xC0AC;&#xD68C; &#xAE30;&#xBC18;&#xC758; &#xB9DD;&#xC580;&#xC871; &#xD2B9;&#xD654; &#xC0B0;&#xBAA8; &#xBC0F; &#xC601;&#xC720;&#xC544; &#xC601;&#xC591;&#xAC1C; &#xC120; &#xC11C;&#xBE44;&#xC2A4; &#xC81C;&#xACF5;2. &#xC9C0;&#xBC29;&#xC815;&#xBD80;&#xC758; &#xB9DD;&#xC580;&#xC871; &#xD3EC;&#xC6A9;&#xC801; &#xC0AC;&#xD68C;&#xC81C;&#xB3C4; &#xC2E4;&#xD589;&#xC5ED;&#xB7C9; &#xAC15;&#xD654; 2.1 &#xC9C0;&#xBC29;&#xC815;&#xBD80;&#xC758; &#xB9DD;&#xC580;&#xC871; &#xD3EC;&#xC6A9;&#xC801; &#xBAA8;&#xC790;&#xBCF4;&#xAC74;&#xD504;&#xB85C;&#xADF8;&#xB7A8; &#xC6B4;&#xC601; &#xAC70; &#xBC84;&#xB10C;&#xC2A4; &#xCCB4;&#xACC4; &#xC218;&#xB9BD;</narrative>
